---
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as OCC
  participant L as Token Service<br/>lifecycle owner
  participant I as Provider issuer
  participant P as Provider
  C->>L: Configure admitted source and grant<br/>via CredentialRefreshDriver
  L-->>C: Configuration accepted
  Note over C,L: Accepted ≠ warm
  Note over L,P: One owner per family#59; prepare even without requests
  L->>L: Lock / fence shared refresh<br/>Recheck admitted state<br/>Persist uncertainty marker
  Note over L,P: Permitted inputs via Secret Driver<br/>Canonical replacement must not be<br/>overwritten by the bootstrap seed
  Note over L,I: Check issuer authority<br/>before input use<br/>or provider I/O
  L->>I: Prepare for the exact admitted grant
  I->>P: Obtain or renew provider material
  P-->>I: Material or failure
  I->>I: Validate grant<br/>and expiry
  I-->>L: Validated material or failure
  alt Validated material
    L->>L: Persist replacement<br/>before warm readiness
    L-->>C: Warm readiness
  else Failed or uncertain preparation
    L->>L: Retain attempt evidence<br/>Reconcile or reauthorize
    L-->>C: Not ready#59; report failure
  end
  Note over C,I: Required material not warm within startup bound:<br/>block startup and report status
  Note over C,L: Authorized management may request preparation<br/>through this same owner#59; no second refresher
